# Put on the medium's package pool (not installed in the live system): Calamares installs the boot
# loader into the new system from here, offline (calamares-sources-media + bootloader-config).
# UEFI only for 0.1: grub-pc (BIOS) conflicts with grub-efi-amd64 in one pool. The ISO still boots
# on BIOS machines, but installs need UEFI (see KNOWN_ISSUES.md).
grub-efi
grub-efi-amd64
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
cryptsetup-initramfs
keyutils
